  "description": "Prince Myung Yiyoon of Hwan, burdened by a perilous royal lineage and a secret healing ability, encounters Emperor Ki Woohee in the palace gardens. Despite Woohee's apparent interest and courtship, Yiyoon must navigate the dangers of trusting a powerful figure with an ulterior motive. Will Yiyoon be able to discover the emperor’s true intentions, resisting the seductive trap he has set just for him?\n\n**Original Novel:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1962134397), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/novel/mh1539), [Bookcube](https://www.bookcube.com/detail.asp?series_num=918000469)\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000048471), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=10637136), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/58083081)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[English](https://www.lezhinus.com/en/comic/sweetest_snare), [Japanese](https://jp.piccoma.com/web/product/107775)",
